WEBVTT

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.830
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.370
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.830
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.370
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.950
Kasel and his friends arrive at Ogria Mountain.

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:34.080
They learn that Chief Aeatola
has already passed away.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:39.740
The current chief, Sieg,
sends Kasel to the Holy Shrine.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:43.910
He says there is a test awaiting Kasel there.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.910
They will be held as hostage.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:52.490
If the ancestral spirits determine that
you are not the heir to the Holy Sword,

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.330
you will die.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:30.910
<i></i>The Time

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:30.910
<i></i>for Trial

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:37.620
This is the Holy Shrine...

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:42.580
Only the chosen ones
are permitted to go any further.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:47.240
This shrine is a sacred place,
used by us shamans for training.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:51.580
Deep inside is an altar,
where a test will be given to you.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.200
Please maintain a strong heart.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.490
Yes.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.950
They didn't take away my staff
or anything, is that okay?

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:13.240
They think they can take us down any time.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.950
Let them underestimate us.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.410
Hmm.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:22.950
Anyway, this seems like a peaceful place,
once the commotion died down.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:26.540
I wonder if the Orcs are a peaceful people
in normal circumstances.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.990
Who knows?

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:30.580
Maybe they're always like that?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:32.660
Just playing life by ear.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.660
What was that silence?

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.450
You shouldn't be the one talking.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:59.040
That must be the altar...

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.870
Who goes there?

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:12.410
This is a holy place... Who are you?

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.910
Show us your heart.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:15.790
Heart?

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:20.950
Do you have a strong heart, or a weak heart?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:21.870
Show us.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.040
Show us.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.990
Show us your heart.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:25.660
Show us.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.120
Show us.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.240
Show us your heart.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.040
Show us.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:33.120
Show us.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.540
Kasel.

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.370
Kasel.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.830
Kasel.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.870
This voice...

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.330
Kasel.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.700
Kasel.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.540
Good morning, Kasel.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:17.790
Right on time for breakfast. Come here.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:18.870
Yeah!

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.290
Wow!

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:24.120
Enjoy.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.700
Yes!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:29.830
The weather is great today.
Shall we go on a walk later?

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.490
Yay!

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:35.660
That human, the heir to
the Holy Sword? Doubtful.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:39.240
Besides, the way he defied Chief Sieg, terrible!

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.950
Ah, I'd love to cut him open!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.910
How barbaric.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.540
What?!

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.660
Leave them alone. He won't come back anyway.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.540
Then, these ones are finished, too.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.660
Indeed!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:59.160
Kasel already had one seal unlocked.

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:02.370
He's really, truly the heir to the Holy Sword!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.660
Cut it out.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:05.870
I'll see them all crying about this later.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.950
Crying? Really?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:12.620
But I do worry about
what the nature of this test is.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:16.540
It does sound interesting.
I'd like to give it a shot.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:17.330
Huh?

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.290
You'd probably just have a terrible time.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:25.700
Maybe. But since Kasel is the actual heir,
we already know how he'll turn up.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:29.540
So then, aren't you curious what
would happen if someone else went in?

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:30.620
Nope.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.450
Whatever.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:36.080
Hey, do you guys know what happens?

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.080
Silent treatment?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:44.240
Well, at any rate, all we can do is wait.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.660
Yes...

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:49.990
Oh, so bored. Boring!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:55.660
Hey, don't you guys throw
guest welcoming parties or something?

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.870
Hey, say something.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:04.080
Get up. We're moving you.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.290
What for?

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.490
You're too annoying!

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:15.330
Come on, Mom!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.990
Oh, Kasel, you run very fast.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:20.040
I'll hold that for you!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.410
Thank you. You're so helpful.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.540
Really?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.580
Yes!

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.580
Yummy!

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.160
There's plenty to eat.

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:40.450
Yeah!

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:48.330
Mom, I have so much I want
to talk to you about!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.370
What is it?

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:51.040
Well...

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:55.830
Um... Huh? What was it?

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:58.410
I really had a lot!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:03.040
I'm sure you'll remember.
There's plenty of time.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.040
Yeah!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.660
The weather really is nice.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:14.160
It feels like it's been a long time
since I spent time with you like this.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:18.620
What are you saying?
We're together every day.

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.370
You're right.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:21.490
Yes...

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.910
I hope Kasel is okay...

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.870
Don't worry. He'll be back.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:47.240
Don't come!

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.410
The walls... The walls!

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.330
At least one of us is relaxed.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:08.290
You should go to bed now.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.830
No, I don't want to sleep yet.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:14.040
You should sleep now, or else
you won't be able to get up tomorrow.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:17.490
Yeah, but just a little longer...

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.790
I want to be with you, Mom.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.450
Just a little more, then.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.120
Good morning, Kasel.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.740
Right on time for breakfast. Come here.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.330
Um, yeah...

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:43.450
Enjoy.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.160
Yeah...

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:49.620
The weather is great today.
Shall we go on a walk later?

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.450
Huh? Um... Yeah.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.290
Mom?!

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.160
What's wrong?

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.740
I don't know. Something, just now...

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:03.990
Huh?

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:09.370
Kasel.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.120
It's all right. Don't think.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:16.990
I know, but something is wrong...

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:20.910
Nothing is wrong. You're being funny.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:23.490
Something is wrong, because...

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:27.370
I already told you. You don't have to think.

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:32.910
No...!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:34.240
Kasel?

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:39.370
Because... Because, Mother, you're...

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.290
Mother is dead!

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.370
Why?

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:52.240
If you didn't remember,
you could have stayed happy.

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:55.790
No. I have to go.

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:59.450
Let's start over from that day, Kasel.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.790
Just say none of those things happened.

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.830
Nothing happened...?

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:09.120
Yes. The village was
not attacked by Demons,

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.700
nothing made you sad.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:17.200
Best of all, your mother never left you.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:19.910
Wouldn't that be preferable?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:27.240
Stay here. Stay here,
and just do the things you enjoy.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:29.080
But... But I...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.290
Who cares about the Holy Sword?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.410
Huh...?

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:37.370
You don't have to be burdened by
everything all by yourself.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.540
I'm not burdened.

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:44.740
I know that, deep down, you curse the world.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:45.950
Huh?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:50.120
If only there were no Demons.
If only your mother survived.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:53.410
Then none of these things
would have happened to you...

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.660
That's...

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:59.410
If you weren't the heir to the Holy Sword,
you wouldn't need to fight Demons.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:02.410
You wouldn't need to watch people die.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:05.080
You don't need to suffer any further.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.830
I know you've been through a lot.
I'm proud of you.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:15.830
But that ends today.
Just stay here with me.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.160
I can't.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:24.740
Even as we speak, more and more people
are suffering because of the Demons.

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:28.790
I have to get the Holy Sword, no matter what!

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.540
Kasel.

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:40.660
If you leave here, you can never see me again.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:45.290
I don't ever want to lose
anyone dear to me again.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:48.410
That's why I have to go.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.660
Everyone is waiting for me, so...

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.200
Goodbye...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.290
...Mother.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:06.990
Heir of the Holy Sword.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:11.990
My name is Aeatola.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.580
Chief Aeatola?!

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:17.040
I congratulate you for
defeating your own illusion.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.330
Illusion...?

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:24.660
This shrine serves to test
the heart of shamans.

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:27.240
Those who enter are shown
a world that they desire.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:31.790
Their heart is tested to see if
it can withstand that desire.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.330
So...

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.540
All of that... Even my mother was...

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:42.080
The human heart is weak, unable to
resist sweet dreams of happiness.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.450
If your heart was weaker,

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:49.790
it would have been
trapped in the illusion forever.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:53.120
The fate of the world rests in your hands.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.790
Good luck...

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:18.740
Oh, I knew it, I'm a super genius...

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:23.660
Master Kaulah has returned!

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.870
The human is with him!

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:28.950
Huh?

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:36.580
Kasel!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:39.290
Welcome back. Took you long enough.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.040
You slept the entire time.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.490
No, I didn't!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:43.610
You were asleep.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.290
Huh?!

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:47.080
You said your cape was
in the way and took it off.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:50.330
I left you alone since I got tired
of dealing with you.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.790
I have no memory of that at all...

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:07.040
Chief Sieg, we have returned.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.660
Yes.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.450
Please.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.200
Listen, all of you!

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:24.080
This talisman is indeed the one
that Chief Aeatola left behind!

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.120
So is he really...?

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:29.290
Kasel.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.330
Yes.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:34.160
I will unlock the seal. Are you ready?

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.410
Yes!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.700
Yay!

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:08.790
Hey, did you feel something this time?

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.490
Well, no...

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:14.450
What?! You've unlocked two seals already!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:17.870
You should be two-thirds of the way
full power to beat the Dark Lord!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:23.120
Don't you have like a, "Boom!"
or "Grah!" kind of thing going? At all?

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.330
I really don't feel anything.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.740
What a letdown!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.620
I'm sorry...

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:39.660
What? What is this power?

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.040
Could it be...?

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:51.040
I don't know what you saw
or experienced in the test,

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.450
but remember what happened there.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:54.290
Huh...?

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:58.620
The test was originally designed
as a rite of passage for shamans.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:05.490
I have been told that it affects
the weakest part of a person's mind.

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:07.080
Yes...

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:12.740
Feed on that weak part, and become stronger,
as a person, and as a warrior.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:17.240
You are the heir to the Holy Sword.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:20.200
But moreover, you must be a warrior.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:23.240
You must be at the vanguard and fight.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:28.040
Just like the previous warrior
of the Holy Sword, King Kyle.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:30.240
Like King Kyle...

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:35.620
One hundred years ago, we Orcs fought
alongside King Kyle against the Demons.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:38.120
Chief Aeatola was one of those who fought.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:44.740
We have nothing but respect towards
those who fought against the threat of evil.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:52.080
That is because even those who did not
have the Holy Sword chose to fight.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.240
We are the same.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.830
When the time comes,

00:17:55.830 --> 00:18:01.910
I will be by the Holy Sword's side,
for my honor as a warrior.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:03.660
Yes.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:07.660
Fight in a way befitting
the honor of the Holy Sword.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:08.620
Yes!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:13.040
Kasel, friends, I wish you good luck.

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:19.700
Who are you?!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.540
Where is the Holy Sword Aea?

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:22.790
What...?

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.540
I'm sure I felt the Holy Sword's power...

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.080
Black-haired human...

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.240
Are you the sorcerer they spoke of?!

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:39.290
He's the human that gave
our friends to the Demons...?

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:47.540
"Human"? Don't equate me
with such lowly creatures.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:53.910
It is I! I, Malduk, am the one who has
created the undead and sent them back!

00:18:57.040 --> 00:19:02.540
Malduk?! The same Malduk that brought
in the Dark Lord 100 years ago?

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.620
How dare you!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.120
Chief Sieg!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:21.620
Still alive?

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.790
How dare you hurt Chief Sieg!

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:32.700
Huh?

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:37.830
Boring. It broke already.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:43.370
I'll get him...!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.910
I'll take him down!

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.330
Let's go!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:46.790
Yes!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.120
Obviously!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.290
Go!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.490
The power of the Holy Sword!

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:01.240
It's coming from you!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.370
Get out of my way!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.040
My...

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:27.700
My hair!

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.200
Frey!

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.450
Frey!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.200
A mere human, after all.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.870
No match for me.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:47.080
Hate me.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:51.290
Hate this cruel world, hate your weak self.

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:55.910
Those drenched in hate
are pitiful, yet beautiful.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:04.490
What the... He's much stronger than before.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.950
You're awake!

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:20.620
Kasel...

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.910
This is...

00:21:57.660 --> 00:21:59.040
Kasel!

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:05.080
Hey, Kasel! Kasel!

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:06.660
Come on!

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:09.910
Kasel...

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:13.370
Kasel...!

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:52.410
Kasel's powers go out of control
during his battle against Malduk.

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:55.580
He is knocked unconscious
and refuses to wake up.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:24:00.790
What can I do to protect Kasel, Clause?

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:00.830
<i></i>To My

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:00.830
<i></i>Dear Friend...
